; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">국제화 및 과학문화 확산을 통한 수리과학문화 창달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">구미시 발전을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">통하여 국가와 지역대학이 함께 발전하는데 기여함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">위 이기수 교수님은 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1982.2.17. ~ 2015.8.31.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">30</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">여년을 교수 등으로 재직하면서 투철한 사명감으로 교육 및 연구 활동을 통하여 기술인재 양상과 다년간 학회 활동으로 우리나라 학술진흥에 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">크게 기여함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">행정사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">포상 추천에 대한 의견이 있는 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">공개기간 내에 담당자 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">E-mail</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">로 의견을 보내주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: 